{"title":"Silverpeak Fir Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3 data-section-id=\"1tpu6a1\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"66\"\u003eDiscover the Magic of Silverpeak Fir Artificial Christmas Trees\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"804\"\u003eBring home an enchanting holiday centerpiece with the Silverpeak Fir collection from Carol's Christmas Conifers. Crafted with premium PE and PVC foliage for a lush, realistic appearance, the Silverpeak Fir is designed to charm from the moment it goes up. Its full, beautifully layered silhouette and rich green foliage create a stunning foundation to any holiday vision. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"804\"\u003ePre-lit with clustered micro LED twinkle lights in both warm white and multicolor options, the Silverpeak Fir delivers a sparkling, layered glow that instantly turns your home into a warm and festive holiday retreat. With 10 lighting modes, a built in timer, and slow twinkle as one of the most loved features, this tree is thoughtfully designed to deliver a magical visual experience night after night.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-start=\"430\" data-end=\"804\"\u003eWhy choose the Silverpeak Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Silverpeak Fir is the ideal choice for those who want a premium realistic artificial Christmas tree with a lighting experience that is as impressive as its realism. Its clustered micro LED twinkle lights create a depth of sparkle and warmth that goes beyond the standard pre-lit tree. The lights are nestled within the layered realistic branch tips, and with its lush green foliage, the Silverpeak Fir is a tree that looks stunning with or without decor.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat lighting options does the Silverpeak Fir have?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Silverpeak Fir comes pre-lit with clustered micro LED twinkle lights and 10 lighting modes, including steady warm white, slow twinkling, multicolor and pastel multicolor all controlled effortlessly from an included remote. Switch between modes, set your preferred brightness, and schedule your tree to light up and power down automatically all from the comfort of your couch.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith Power Pole Technology, setup is seamless. No tangled cords, no complicated connections. Simply assemble, connect and your tree lights up instantly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Silverpeak Fir a realistic Christmas tree?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Silverpeak Fir is part of our \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/premium-trees\" title=\"Premium Artificial Christmas Trees\"\u003epremium realistic artificial Christmas tree collection\u003c\/a\u003e, which is our most realistic Christmas trees. Its mixed PE and PVC foliage closely replicates the texture, depth and natural variation of a real Christmas tree. When lit, the clustered micro LED twinkle lights glow from within the foliage, creating a warm, immersive depth that makes the Silverpeak Fir one of the most visually stunning trees in our collection.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eWhat decorating style works best with the Silverpeak Fir?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Silverpeak Fir's realistic foliage, and perfectly placed built in lighting make it a beautiful foundation for any holiday decorating style. For a traditional look, it pairs lovely with classic red and gold ornaments, \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/ribbons\" title=\"Christmas Ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e and decorative garland. For a warm, neutral aesthetic, try cream and champagne tones, natural wood accents and woven \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/picks\" title=\"Decorative Picks\"\u003etree picks\u003c\/a\u003e tucked within the branches for added texture. For a rustic or woodland inspired theme, \u003ca href=\"/\/products\/4-pack-pine-cone?variant=42319137308872\" title=\"Pine Cone Ornaments\"\u003epinecones\u003c\/a\u003e, and earthy tones blend beautifully against the deep green foliage.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts warm twinkle lighting setting creates an intimate glow that pairs beautifully across any decorating style, while the multicolor setting brings a vibrant, festive energy perfect for family gatherings and holiday entertaining.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003eIs the Silverpeak Fir easy to assemble and store?\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes. The Silverpeak Fir is designed for easy setup and long term durability. Its hinged branch construction allows branches to fall naturally into place during assembly. To get the best results, plan to spend some time shaping and fluffing the individual branch tips by hand. Once shaped out of the box, the Silverpeak Fir looks full, lush, and beautifully realistic with minimal ongoing effort required.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEach tree includes a sturdy stand, and complimentary setup gloves to help you shape and fluff the branches during assembly. A complimentary storage bag is also included to keep your tree protected between holiday seasons.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen the season is over, the Silverpeak Fir disassembles easily and should be stored neatly in a cool, dry place to preserve its foliage, lighting, and overall condition for many seasons to come.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore the Silverpeak Fir collection, and find the size that brings warmth, realism, and a truly magical holiday glow into your home this season.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5'","offer_id":44792072896712,"sku":"SLP-T6.5-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"7.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 3400 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"7.5'","offer_id":44792074764488,"sku":"SLP-T7.5-L","price":1199.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"},{"product_id":"9-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"9' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 4700 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"9'","offer_id":45128150778056,"sku":"SLP-T9-LUX","price":1899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/lavenderrosehome--k-o-c-holiday-home-tour-campaign--2025-12-01-02-53-07--instagram_1.jpg?v=1765554363","url":"/\/collections\/silverpeak-fir-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}